WEBVTT

00:01:40.915 --> 00:01:42.249
And so Kagato, the man who claimed

00:01:42.249 --> 00:01:46.420
to be the emperor and king of
planet Jurai had been vanquished.

00:01:46.420 --> 00:01:51.759
And I suppose that was
when I realized for the first time

00:01:51.759 --> 00:01:55.354
the reason why Grandpa
decided not to take the throne.

00:02:19.353 --> 00:02:23.390
We were proven innocent of
treason and all other charges,

00:02:23.390 --> 00:02:27.224
and Ayeka was free to become
one of Jurai's royal family.

00:02:30.197 --> 00:02:33.834
The truth was finally
broadcast all over the universe

00:02:33.834 --> 00:02:36.632
and, of course, caused quite a
stir among the general public.

00:02:43.777 --> 00:02:48.048
The media made such a big deal out of it,

00:02:48.048 --> 00:02:52.007
but I felt as though the whole thing
had been a dream, now that it was over.

00:02:53.187 --> 00:02:55.789
Ayeka was very generous

00:02:55.789 --> 00:02:58.659
and decided not to punish
anyone involved in the incident,

00:02:58.659 --> 00:03:02.429
but as you might imagine many of
those responsible for the conspiracy

00:03:02.429 --> 00:03:04.590
left their jobs of their own accord.

00:03:09.703 --> 00:03:12.194
And as for my Grandpa...

00:03:15.376 --> 00:03:16.610
Come on, everyone.

00:03:16.610 --> 00:03:19.246
Did you think I was going to die that easily?

00:03:19.246 --> 00:03:22.783
- You know me better than that, don't you?
- Here's a hot towel for you.

00:03:22.783 --> 00:03:25.013
- Oh, great. Thank you.
- Here's a hot towel for you.

00:03:27.388 --> 00:03:32.519
Needless to say, Grandpa
and Dad couldn't be happier.

00:03:38.032 --> 00:03:40.067
- We're ready to go.
- We're ready to go.

00:03:40.067 --> 00:03:43.468
Okay, then. I'm transmitting energy now.

00:03:54.882 --> 00:03:56.150
Hello, everyone.

00:03:56.150 --> 00:03:59.086
- Good morning!
- Good morning!

00:03:59.086 --> 00:04:02.957
The guardians, Azaka and Kamidake
were brought back to life safely,

00:04:02.957 --> 00:04:08.295
and the two knights... that is
the original Azaka and Kamidake...

00:04:08.295 --> 00:04:11.423
are enjoying their lives as humans again.

00:04:12.399 --> 00:04:14.969
- One...
- Not so fast.

00:04:14.969 --> 00:04:16.370
Take that! Take that!

00:04:16.370 --> 00:04:18.038
- And that!
- I've got you now!

00:04:18.038 --> 00:04:20.302
- There!
- Oops. Oh, no!

00:04:22.042 --> 00:04:25.045
Azaka's completely
hooked on that video game,

00:04:25.045 --> 00:04:30.017
so he looks up to Sasami as his master
and is now serving as her apprentice.

00:04:30.017 --> 00:04:33.475
Now, this time I'll win, so let us play!

00:04:39.093 --> 00:04:44.793
Washu was elected as honorary president
of the Universal Science Academy.

00:05:02.783 --> 00:05:07.187
Thanks. Although I think it's
quite natural for me to be appointed

00:05:07.187 --> 00:05:08.956
honorary president of the science academy,

00:05:08.956 --> 00:05:13.294
I still feel very moved, moved
to the point of tears, almost.

00:05:13.294 --> 00:05:16.430
What I say next comes
from the bottom of my heart.

00:05:16.430 --> 00:05:21.527
I hereby pledge that my scientific skills
will be employed only in the pursuit of peace!

00:05:31.578 --> 00:05:35.683
A month later, it was discovered
that Washu was developing a weapon

00:05:35.683 --> 00:05:40.054
that would destroy the universe
and she was kicked out of the academy.

00:05:40.054 --> 00:05:42.420
Bet you had a hard time guessing that.

00:05:45.959 --> 00:05:50.191
Mihoshi and Kiyone
returned to the Galaxy Police.

00:05:52.833 --> 00:05:58.703
Kiyone, who had had more than her
share of bad luck in life, was finally happy.

00:06:02.242 --> 00:06:05.109
She got a promotion to the
position of detective sergeant.

00:06:05.913 --> 00:06:09.149
Sarge, I brought you some tea.

00:06:09.149 --> 00:06:11.174
Ah, thanks.

00:06:15.189 --> 00:06:17.157
What is this stuff?!

00:06:17.157 --> 00:06:20.888
Making a decent cup of tea
can't be that difficult, can it?!

00:06:22.596 --> 00:06:26.333
You know who made great tea?
Sasami made great tea, that's who.

00:06:26.333 --> 00:06:28.535
Err... sorry about that.

00:06:28.535 --> 00:06:30.867
I'll make it better next time.

00:06:39.279 --> 00:06:41.181
Frankly, Mihoshi seems to be avoiding

00:06:41.181 --> 00:06:43.350
her responsibilities as a
chief criminal prevention officer.

00:06:43.350 --> 00:06:48.447
She's always hanging around with
Kiyone, but they seem to be doing fine.

00:06:49.823 --> 00:06:54.419
Who I cannot tell you about is Ryoko.
Her whereabouts are still unknown.

00:07:05.739 --> 00:07:07.074
Hey...

00:07:07.074 --> 00:07:09.243
What can I get you?

00:07:09.243 --> 00:07:12.542
Have you seen this woman around?

00:07:13.814 --> 00:07:15.873
I'm sorry. No.

00:07:16.717 --> 00:07:18.085
Is she a friend of yours?

00:07:18.085 --> 00:07:19.882
- What?!
- Huh?

00:07:22.589 --> 00:07:24.682
Are you kidding?

00:07:33.000 --> 00:07:34.902
What are you looking at?

00:07:34.902 --> 00:07:36.336
Huh?

00:07:36.336 --> 00:07:38.668
Just the scenery of Jurai.

00:07:42.242 --> 00:07:44.540
It's so beautiful.

00:07:46.413 --> 00:07:49.683
Which place is more beautiful
to you, the Earth or Jurai?

00:07:49.683 --> 00:07:51.752
Both places are beautiful.

00:07:51.752 --> 00:07:54.721
This planet has some
things the Earth doesn't have

00:07:54.721 --> 00:07:57.758
and the Earth has some
things that Jurai doesn't have.

00:07:57.758 --> 00:07:59.385
I suppose you're right.

00:08:01.495 --> 00:08:04.293
So lovely. So wonderful.

00:08:05.432 --> 00:08:10.170
Ohh... are you really leaving?

00:08:10.170 --> 00:08:11.797
Mm-hmm.

00:08:15.375 --> 00:08:16.899
Sasami?

00:08:19.780 --> 00:08:22.649
We'll meet again, won't we, Tenchi?

00:08:22.649 --> 00:08:23.484
Of course.

00:08:23.484 --> 00:08:24.974
Tenchi.

00:08:27.087 --> 00:08:30.079
Princess Ayeka would
like to see you, Tenchi.

00:08:50.777 --> 00:08:54.081
Well, my vacation is over now, Tenchi.

00:08:54.081 --> 00:08:57.209
This time, I'm afraid, it's over for good.

00:08:59.720 --> 00:09:04.124
Your decision to leave is not
going to change, is it, Tenchi?

00:09:04.124 --> 00:09:05.225
No.

00:09:05.225 --> 00:09:10.097
You could have everything you ever wanted,
if you accepted the throne, you know.

00:09:10.097 --> 00:09:12.622
Do you really think so, Ayeka?

00:09:13.367 --> 00:09:17.538
Maybe if I had been raised by Jurai's
royal family from the start, Ayeka,

00:09:17.538 --> 00:09:21.141
but then I wouldn't have all those wonderful
memories with you and everyone else.

00:09:21.141 --> 00:09:24.645
All those experiences are
not allowed Jurai's emperor.

00:09:24.645 --> 00:09:27.011
Probably not.

00:09:28.282 --> 00:09:32.152
Well, I'm sorry, but I guess I'm
supposed to live an ordinary life

00:09:32.152 --> 00:09:33.954
without much responsibility.

00:09:33.954 --> 00:09:35.785
I think I'm like Grandpa that way.

00:09:38.492 --> 00:09:43.897
And I am supposed to live my life as
the crown princess, as I have all along.

00:09:43.897 --> 00:09:44.898
Huh?

00:09:44.898 --> 00:09:50.928
And I'm proud I have because
this is the only life I know, Tenchi.

00:09:53.807 --> 00:09:56.037
Ayeka.

00:09:59.146 --> 00:10:02.416
I really want to thank you very much.

00:10:02.416 --> 00:10:07.251
I want to thank you for a
really wonderful vacation, Tenchi.

00:10:21.234 --> 00:10:24.004
I will not see you off
when you leave, Tenchi,

00:10:24.004 --> 00:10:29.203
but I sincerely hope your journey
back to the Earth will be a safe one.

00:10:35.949 --> 00:10:40.682
And that was the last time I saw Ayeka.

00:10:55.535 --> 00:10:58.936
So I'm back on Earth again.

00:11:04.044 --> 00:11:07.980
Ryu-Oh's tree has grown so tall.

00:11:13.553 --> 00:11:15.188
It's spring now.

00:11:15.188 --> 00:11:17.524
I'm back in school again,

00:11:17.524 --> 00:11:20.789
and the days I spent in space
were regarded as an excused absence.

00:11:35.809 --> 00:11:39.870
Everything is just like
before: Calm and peaceful.

00:11:40.614 --> 00:11:43.845
Just ordinary, everyday life. No problems.

00:11:50.090 --> 00:11:52.684
Grandpa hasn't changed a bit.

00:11:53.794 --> 00:11:55.284
Hello.

00:11:58.799 --> 00:12:03.704
Who would ever imagine that
a Shinto priest in a small town

00:12:03.704 --> 00:12:06.264
could have been the ruler of the universe?

00:12:09.342 --> 00:12:14.609
Dad's still diligently going to the office,
complaining about the long commute.

00:12:15.248 --> 00:12:16.738
Here you go.

00:12:20.821 --> 00:12:23.255
He hasn't changed, either.

00:12:25.192 --> 00:12:29.429
We still have the karaoke
set we bought in space.

00:12:29.429 --> 00:12:32.766
We've never used it
since we came back to Earth.

00:12:32.766 --> 00:12:36.634
It just sits there in the corner
of the room collecting dust.

00:13:36.863 --> 00:13:40.458
Like I said... calm and peaceful.

00:14:02.122 --> 00:14:04.920
"For Rent"

00:14:05.625 --> 00:14:09.996
Hurry up, Mihoshi or we're
gonna be late for work again!

00:14:09.996 --> 00:14:14.100
Oh, Kiyone, wait for me, please!
I'll be there in a minute.

00:14:14.100 --> 00:14:16.591
Mihoshi, you always make us late!

00:14:43.296 --> 00:14:44.898
Hey, Tenchi!

00:14:44.898 --> 00:14:46.132
Huh?

00:14:46.132 --> 00:14:47.367
The hot tub is ready.

00:14:47.367 --> 00:14:49.169
Why don't you go ahead and take a bath?

00:14:49.169 --> 00:14:51.160
Thank you. I'm coming.

00:15:16.897 --> 00:15:22.858
Just an ordinary
bathroom now. Nothing special.

00:15:34.314 --> 00:15:36.612
I'm off to school now. Good-bye!

00:16:06.246 --> 00:16:09.316
Tenchi, we are having fun, aren't we?

00:16:09.316 --> 00:16:12.385
Every day here is like a carnival.

00:16:12.385 --> 00:16:16.723
I hope it's going to be like this forever.

00:16:16.723 --> 00:16:18.714
Tenchi?

00:16:38.578 --> 00:16:42.582
Now those days seem like a dream to me,

00:16:42.582 --> 00:16:44.812
sort of like a carnival
I thought would never end.

00:16:46.019 --> 00:16:50.957
I remember when it all started.

00:16:50.957 --> 00:16:59.933
It started when I saw Ryo-Ohki
falling to Earth, but... it's all over now.

00:16:59.933 --> 00:17:02.094
The carnival is gone.

00:17:14.247 --> 00:17:15.737
Tenchi.

00:18:00.660 --> 00:18:02.150
Hey.

00:18:18.178 --> 00:18:20.976
Tenchi!

00:18:26.119 --> 00:18:29.522
I told you I was a space
pirate and a powerful one,

00:18:29.522 --> 00:18:32.192
and I have come to steal you away.

00:18:32.192 --> 00:18:33.726
Ryoko, I thought...

00:18:33.726 --> 00:18:36.663
Now, don't you worry.
I'm not gonna do anything violent.

00:18:36.663 --> 00:18:38.498
This is what I'm gonna do.

00:18:38.498 --> 00:18:41.956
I'm gonna confront Ayeka, and
win your heart in the fairest of fights.

00:18:44.304 --> 00:18:46.106
Well, come on now.

00:18:46.106 --> 00:18:49.542
You don't think Ayeka's going
to give you up that easily, do you?

00:20:09.122 --> 00:20:11.457
- Now... there!
- Princess Sasami, we've got a situation here!

00:20:11.457 --> 00:20:14.761
I found this note in Princess Ayeka's room.

00:20:14.761 --> 00:20:16.626
Huh?

00:20:18.464 --> 00:20:21.334
No way! Ayeka's decided to run away!

00:20:21.334 --> 00:20:23.336
I'm going back there, too!

00:20:23.336 --> 00:20:24.737
Uh... Princess Sasami!

00:20:24.737 --> 00:20:26.039
Please, hold on a minute!

00:20:26.039 --> 00:20:27.840
- Princess Sasami?
- Princess Sasami, come back!

00:20:27.840 --> 00:20:28.741
Princess Sasami!

00:20:28.741 --> 00:20:30.944
Oh, no. What now?

00:20:30.944 --> 00:20:33.435
What are we going to do?

00:20:43.089 --> 00:20:49.187
I'm telling you, I just know they're
all coming back here, definitely.

00:20:56.803 --> 00:20:58.668
"For Rent"

00:21:12.352 --> 00:21:15.388
You know what, Tenchi?

00:21:15.388 --> 00:21:18.758
The carnival comes and goes.

00:21:18.758 --> 00:21:23.923
If you wait for a while,
it'll always come back to you.

00:21:31.938 --> 00:21:33.803
I guess you're right, Ryoko.

00:21:34.307 --> 00:21:35.831
I guess you're right.

00:21:41.147 --> 00:21:45.481
"Tenchi Muyo!"
